<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-sanguozhi" book-id="b-sanguozhi-048" chapter-id="c-sanguozhi-048-jin043-shiwei" source-id="s-sanguozhi-048-jin043-shiwei">
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-048-jin043-shiwei:name" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note"><persName id="c-sanguozhi-048-jin043-shiwei:name:m0000" ref="vi3_qvk_pdi">石偉</persName>字<persName id="c-sanguozhi-048-jin043-shiwei:name:m0003" ref="vi3_qvk_pdi">公操</persName>，南郡人。</p>
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-048-jin043-shiwei:wuoffice" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note"><persName id="c-sanguozhi-048-jin043-shiwei:wuoffice:m0000" ref="0fo_c5c_4yh">孫休</persName>即位，特徵<persName id="c-sanguozhi-048-jin043-shiwei:wuoffice:m0007" ref="vi3_qvk_pdi">偉</persName>，累遷至光祿勳。</p>
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-048-jin043-shiwei:wu_retire" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note">及<persName id="c-sanguozhi-048-jin043-shiwei:wu_retire:m0001" ref="05e_9bb_55a">皓</persName>即位，朝政昏亂，<persName id="c-sanguozhi-048-jin043-shiwei:wu_retire:m0010" ref="vi3_qvk_pdi">偉</persName>乃辭老耄痼疾乞身，就拜光祿大夫。</p>
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-048-jin043-shiwei:visit" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note">吳平，建威將軍<persName id="c-sanguozhi-048-jin043-shiwei:visit:m0007" ref="48e_04a_3d8">王戎</persName>親詣<persName id="c-sanguozhi-048-jin043-shiwei:visit:m0011" ref="vi3_qvk_pdi">偉</persName>。</p>
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-048-jin043-shiwei:decree" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note">其以<persName id="c-sanguozhi-048-jin043-shiwei:decree:m0002" ref="vi3_qvk_pdi">偉</persName>爲議郎，加二千石秩，以終厥世。</p>
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-048-jin043-shiwei:outcome" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note"><persName id="c-sanguozhi-048-jin043-shiwei:outcome:m0000" ref="vi3_qvk_pdi">偉</persName>遂陽狂及盲，不受晉爵。年八十三，太熙元年卒。</p>
</text>
